{"4282510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ink Shadow: Zero", "steam_appid": 4282510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World of Shifting Alliances</strong>​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The martial world is woven with multiple dynamic factions. Your choices actively reshape the power balance, as factions evolve based on your journeys, decisions, and interactions with key NPCs. Rejecting rigid &quot;good vs. evil&quot; dichotomies, you can pledge loyalty to one force or navigate rivalries as a lone wanderer. Your reputation and critical choices trigger unique alliances, conflicts, and events, embodying the wuxia ethos: <i>&quot;In this world, you may be constrained by its rules—or master them.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4282510/extras/45ad258e654dc70d694799f5bdaed8e3.poster.avif?t=1786562154\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4282510/extras/45ad258e654dc70d694799f5bdaed8e3.webm?t=1786562154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4282510/extras/45ad258e654dc70d694799f5bdaed8e3.mp4?t=1786562154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Romantic Companionship</strong>​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond clashes of steel, the Jianghu holds emotional depth. Meet female heroes of distinct backgrounds and personalities, forge bonds through shared adventures, and develop relationships rooted in unique storylines. Pursue romance, marriage, and even raise children, who may later aid your journey as combat allies or narrative-driving characters—ensuring your legacy endures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4282510/extras/0ce7acabab6cdd73fbc158340dc81285.poster.avif?t=1786562154\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4282510/extras/0ce7acabab6cdd73fbc158340dc81285.webm?t=1786562154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4282510/extras/0ce7acabab6cdd73fbc158340dc81285.mp4?t=1786562154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customizable Martial Arts System</strong>​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Define your combat style with a vast array of techniques, from open-handed strikes to blade mastery and exotic weapons. Combine forceful external skills with agile internal energy arts to create unique combos and tactics, including hidden disciplines. Combat emphasizes strategic adaptation, requiring tailored approaches against different foes—each encounter as tactical as a planned skirmish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4282510/extras/d21806a5119d1e53fd046304bf8f461b.poster.avif?t=1786562154\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4282510/extras/d21806a5119d1e53fd046304bf8f461b.webm?t=1786562154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4282510/extras/d21806a5119d1e53fd046304bf8f461b.mp4?t=1786562154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration-Driven Adventures</strong>​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprises await in every corner. Beyond main and side quests, interactive environments and hidden secrets reward curiosity. Decode murals in abandoned temples to uncover lost techniques, or heed tavern drunkards’ ramblings to unlock legendary weapon quests. Treasures often tie to your exploration choices, encouraging a truly inquisitive spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4282510/extras/6a2ad868c7df87bde8082f63521e61c9.poster.avif?t=1786562154\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4282510/extras/6a2ad868c7df87bde8082f63521e61c9.webm?t=1786562154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4282510/extras/6a2ad868c7df87bde8082f63521e61c9.mp4?t=1786562154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Cozy, Self-Paced Journey</strong>​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ink Shadow: Zero</i>offers a relaxed wuxia experience, free from grind or pressure. Live at your own pace: fish by streams, spar with friends, or teach your children martial arts in a home courtyard. Casual activities yield steady growth resources, ensuring every player finds their own rhythm in the Jianghu.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World of Shifting Alliances</strong>​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The martial world is woven with multiple dynamic factions. Your choices actively reshape the power balance, as factions evolve based on your journeys, decisions, and interactions with key NPCs. Rejecting rigid &quot;good vs. evil&quot; dichotomies, you can pledge loyalty to one force or navigate rivalries as a lone wanderer. Your reputation and critical choices trigger unique alliances, conflicts, and events, embodying the wuxia ethos: <i>&quot;In this world, you may be constrained by its rules—or master them.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinlin